<title>USA: Collagen says Palefsky resigns as CFO.</title>
<headline>Collagen says Palefsky resigns as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collagen Corp said Monday Howard Palefsky has resigned as chairman of the board and as a director, effective June 20.</p>
<p>In February 1997, Palefsky resigned as chief executive of Collagen Corp.</p>
</text>
